# 2026-11-04 真实 CAN 异常注入

平台：i.MX6ULL + STM32F407，真实 `can0`，500 kbps。

参数：

```text
len   = 100
BS    = 8
STmin = 5 ms
```

> 注：录制时 `mock_ecu` 也曾在总线上，日志里能看到它收到同样的帧。
> 三条故障路径最终都由 STM32 的状态机日志确认；为拿到干净证据，建议 kill `mock_ecu` 后重跑一次。

## 1. 丢 FC：`--drop-fc`

gw：

```text
./gw can0 100 8 5 --drop-fc
{"event":"send","id":"0x7E0","len":100,"fault":3}
{"event":"tx_timeout","tx_state":4,"rx_state":0}
```

STM32：

```text
ISOTP fc: fs=0 bs=8 stmin=5 at 4964103ms pos=6/100 ok
ISOTP rx: N_Cr timeout after 1000ms, got 6/100B (0 CF, 1 FC), dropped
```

结论：gw 不处理 FC，N_Bs 超时；STM32 发出 FC 后等不到 CF，N_Cr 超时。正确。

## 2. 错序 CF：`--mangle-cf 2`

gw：

```text
./gw can0 100 8 5 --mangle-cf 2
{"event":"send","id":"0x7E0","len":100,"fault":2}
{"event":"tx_abort","tx_state":5,"rx_state":0}
```

STM32：

```text
ISOTP fc: fs=0 bs=8 stmin=5 at 4968130ms pos=6/100 ok
ISOTP fc: fs=2 bs=8 stmin=5 at 4968131ms pos=13/100 ok
ISOTP rx: SN mismatch (expected 2, got 3) at 13/100B, FC OVFLW sent
```

结论：STM32 检测到 SN 跳变，发 OVFLW，进入 ABORT；gw 收到 OVFLW 后 TX_ABORT。正确。

## 3. 丢最后一个 CF：`--drop-last-cf`

gw：

```text
./gw can0 100 8 5 --drop-last-cf
{"event":"send","id":"0x7E0","len":100,"fault":1}
{"event":"timeout","tx_state":3,"rx_state":0}
```

STM32：

```text
ISOTP rx: N_Cr timeout after 1049ms, got 97/100B (13 CF, 2 FC), dropped
```

结论：gw 发完前 13 个 CF，最后一个没发；STM32 等最后一个 CF 超时。gw 自己 `TX_DONE`，但等不到回显，最终超时。正确。

## mock_ecu 日志

```text
mock N_Cr timeout (got 97/100), reset
mock ABORT (seq mismatch, OVFLW sent), reset
mock N_Cr timeout (got 6/100), reset
```

说明 mock 也收到了同样的故障帧；它不影响故障路径结论，但干净测试应先停掉 mock。
